A scan line is made of 14 fields of regard (FOR) consisting of 4X4 instantaneous and individual fields of view (FOV), with each FOV having a 12km ground resolution.

IASI-NG level 1c product provides calibrated radiance and geolocated radiance emitted by the Earth over 16921 spectral samples between 645.0 cm-1 and 2760 cm-1 (15.5 µm and 3.63 µm) in four contiguous bands. The raw spectra received from the instrument are rendered independent of the instrument SRF effects by applying a so-called “ISRF removal” i.e. a correction of the effects of the instrument self-apodisation.","identifier":"EO:EUM:DAT:0442","name":"Global IASI-NG Level 1c Spectral Radiance (netCDF) - Metop-SG"}

